eering Impact:** The distinct, non-overlapping upward shift in medians proves that `UtilizationTier` provides a powerful predictive sorting signal. Since the category ordering directly maps to an increasing price structure, implementing **Ordinal Encoding** (`Low: 0, Medium: 1, High: 2`) will allow your model to capture this natural value progression perfectly.","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"# Plot 3.10: Yearly Volume vs. Price Trend\n\nannual_data=train.groupby(tmp['SaleYear'])[TARGET].agg(['median', 'count']).reset_index()\nannual_data=annual_data.rename(columns={'SaleYear': 'Year'})\nfig, ax1=plt.subplots(figsize=(13, 4.5))\nfig.suptitle('Plot 3.10: Yearly Auction Volume vs. Median Price',fontsize=14,fontweight='bold')\nax2=ax1.twinx()\nax1.bar(annual_data['Year'],annual_data['count'],color='lightsteelblue',alpha=0.5, label='Volume')\nax2.plot(annual_data['Year'],annual_data['median'], 'o-',color='darkorange',lw=2.5, label='Median Price')\nax1.set_ylabel(\"Transaction Volume\")\nax2.set_ylabel(\"Median Sale Price ($)\")\nax1.set_xlabel(\"Year of Transaction\")\nh1,l1=ax1.get_legend_handles_labels()\nh2,l2=ax2.get_legend_handles_labels()\nax1.legend(h1+h2,l1+l2, loc='upper left')\nplt.tight_layout()\nplt.show()\n\n# Plot 3.11: Missingness heatmap correlation pattern\nmoderate_miss_cols=miss_df[miss_df['missing_%'].between(20, 80)].index.tolist()[:12]\nfig,ax=plt.subplots(figsize=(13, 5))\nfig.suptitle('Plot 3.11: Missingness Correlation Pattern (Sample 2000 rows)', fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\nsns.heatmap(train[moderate_miss_cols].head(2000).isnull(),cbar=False,yticklabels=False,cmap='YlOrRd',ax=ax)\nax.set_xticklabels(ax.get_xticklabels(),rotation=45,ha='right',fontsize=9)\nplt.tight_layout()\nplt.show()","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-07-17T06:04:22.164385Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-07-17T06:04:22.164757Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-07-17T06:04:22.638354Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-07-17T06:04:22.