.loc[df['ManufactureYear']==1001,'ManufactureYear']=np.nan\n    df['MachineAge']=(df['Trans_Year']-df['ManufactureYear']).clip(lower=0)\n    \n    df['OperationalHoursMeter']=df['OperationalHoursMeter'].clip(upper=60000)\n    df['LogHours']=np.log1p(df['OperationalHoursMeter'])\n    \n    df['Usage_Intensity']=df['OperationalHoursMeter']/ (df['MachineAge'] + 1)\n    df['LogUsage_Intensity'] = np.log1p(df['Usage_Intensity'])\n    \n    return df","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-07-17T09:46:36.769441Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-07-17T09:46:36.770474Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-07-17T09:46:36.77694Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-07-17T09:46:36.770436Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-07-17T09:46:36.776061Z"}},"outputs":[],"execution_count":62},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"### 4.1 Temporal Features (from `TransactionDate`)\n* **`SaleYear`** — Year of auction (captures macro market trends over time)\n* **`SaleMonth`** — Month of auction (seasonal demand effects)\n* **`SaleQuarter`** — Quarter grouping (Q1–Q4)\n* **`MachineAge`** — `SaleYear - ManufactureYear` (age at time of sale — a primary price driver)\n* **`ManufactureYear`** — Anomalous values (`1001`) replaced with `NaN`, then median-imputed\n","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"### 4.2 Usage Features (from `OperationalHoursMeter`)\n* **`Hours_isna`** — Binary flag: `1` if hours are missing (missing ≠ random; older machines often have no meter record)\n* **`OperationalHoursMeter`** — Winsorized at 25,000 hours (physically unrealistic values above this threshold are noise)\n","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"train_eng=engineer_features(train)\ntest_eng=engineer_features(test)\n\ny = np.log1p(train_eng[TARGET])\ndrop_cols = ['TransactionID', 'AssetID', 'TransactionDate', TARGET, 'col18', 'col19',\"col5\",'col4']\n","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-07-17T09:53:44.376504Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-07-17T09:53:44.37